      "reasoning": "Opponent played Tempered Veteran (1/2 that puts +1/+1 counters on things) and is attacking with Skyhunter Prowler (1/3 flying). I can't block it since Ardoz doesn't have flying. \n\
\n\
I could Fiery Conclusion the Prowler by sacrificing Ardoz, dealing 5 damage to it and killing it. But that costs me Ardoz which is my best card for future value. The Prowler only hits for 1 damage per turn. Let me take the 1 damage and keep Ardoz.\n\
\n\
