      "reasoning": "Great, I drew Bolt Hound (2R, 2/2 haste, gives other creatures +1/+0 when it attacks). Opponent played Thriving Heath (tapped, chose Red) and Trusty Retriever 3/4 with a +1/+1 counter (has summoning sickness).\n\
