- Tempered Veteran: 3/4 (2 +1/+1 counters)\n\
- Trusty Retriever: 4/5 (2 +1/+1 counters)\n\
\n\
That's a scary board. I need to think carefully.\n\
\n\
My plan: Play Island (7th land = 7 mana total), then I can cast Scholar of the Lost Trove (5UU)! Scholar is a 5/5 flyer and lets me recast something from my graveyard. I could recast Thirst for Knowledge (draw 3, discard 2) or Meteor Golem (destroy target nonland permanent) for free!\n\
\n\
Wait - Scholar costs 5UU (requires 2 blue). I have 2 Islands + 1 Island from hand = 3 Islands, plus Buried Ruin (colorless) + 3 Mountains. That's 3 blue sources and 4 other mana = 7 total. I can cast it!\n\
\n\
With Scholar's ETB, I should recast Meteor Golem from graveyard for free! That destroys a nonland permanent - I'd target Patron of the Valiant (their 4/4 flyer). Then I'd have a 5/5 flyer AND a 3/3 on board.\n\
\n\
Let me play Island first.",
