\n\
After playing Mountain: 3 Islands + 4 Mountains + 1 Buried Ruin = 8 lands\n\
Scholar costs 5UU = 7 mana (need 2 blue). Use 3 Islands + 4 other lands = 7 mana with 1 leftover.\n\
\n\
But I want to cast Scholar AND have mana for Bolt Hound (2R). That's 10 mana total which I don't have. So just Scholar.\n\
\n\
Actually wait - Scholar lets me cast something from graveyard for FREE. So I should think about what to target:\n\
- **Meteor Golem**: Destroy a nonland permanent (best target: Patron of the Valiant or Tempered Veteran)\n\
- **Thirst for Knowledge**: Draw 3, discard 2 (card advantage)\n\
- **Fiery Conclusion**: Needs a creature sacrifice... not ideal\n\
\n\
Meteor Golem is the clear winner - I get a 5/5 flyer AND a 3/3 that destroys their best permanent.\n\
\n\
Let me play Mountain first, then Scholar.",
