    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Targeted Skyhunter Prowler instead of Tempered Veteran with Fiery Conclusion. Tempered Veteran is a +1/+1 counter engine that already has a counter on it, meaning it can activate for just {W} to put counters on itself or any other creature with a counter. Left alive, it will snowball the opponent's board. The Prowler is a threat but more static.",
