    },
    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Opus Sport passed with 3 untapped mana and no other plays available. Aether Spellbomb could have been sacrificed for {1} to draw a card, using otherwise-wasted mana. Alternatively, bouncing Tempered Veteran for {U} would remove its +1/+1 counter and delay the opponent's engine. Keeping the Spellbomb preserves optionality for future turns, but with Scholar of the Lost Trove planned for next turn (which could recast artifacts from graveyard), the value of holding it is reduced.",
      "action_taken": "Passed priority without activating Aether Spellbomb, wasting 3 available mana.",
      "better_line": "Sacrifice Aether Spellbomb for {1} to draw a card, or pay {U} to bounce Tempered Veteran and strip its +1/+1 counter. Drawing a card with unused mana is generally correct when no other plays exist.",
