    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Opus Sport passed with 3 untapped mana and no other plays available. They could have cycled Aether Spellbomb for {1} to draw a card, digging toward the lands needed for Markov Warlord (6 mana) or Scholar of the Lost Trove (7 mana). With Buried Ruin in hand able to recur the Spellbomb later if the bounce effect is needed, cycling now for card advantage with otherwise wasted mana is clearly better than doing nothing.",
