    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Casting Patron of the Valiant before playing Plains and activating Tempered Veteran's {W},{T} ability. By playing Plains first (6 lands), then activating Tempered Veteran ({W},{T}) to add a +1/+1 counter to a creature, then casting Patron (5 mana remaining), Patron's ETB would see more creatures with +1/+1 counters and distribute more counters. The current sequencing wastes the opportunity to get an extra +1/+1 counter from Tempered Veteran before Patron's ETB resolves.",
      "action_taken": "Cast Patron of the Valiant immediately, using all 5 available mana before playing the Plains in hand or activating Tempered Veteran.",
