      "decision_index": 71,
    },
    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Markov Warlord's ETB ability makes up to two creatures unable to block this turn. With Patron of the Valiant being sick and the other two blockers (Tempered Veteran and Trusty Retriever) presumably targeted by the ETB, no creature can block. This is a free 4 damage to an opponent at 15 life. Even if ETB wasn't used optimally, attacking with a 4/4 haste creature that was cast specifically to pressure the opponent is critical, especially against a board that's growing with +1/+1 counters.",
      "action_taken": "Declined to attack with Markov Warlord.",
