      "description": "At 10 life facing 8 damage from Patron of the Valiant (4/4 flying) and Trusty Retriever (4/5), Opus Sport passed without activating Aether Spellbomb to bounce the Patron. By bouncing Patron and blocking Retriever with Markov Warlord, they could take 0 damage and stay at 10 life. Instead, they'll take at least 4 damage (blocking Retriever) or 8 (not blocking), dropping to dangerous life totals of 6 or 2.",
