    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Sacrificed Aether Spellbomb to draw a card when saving it for next turn's bounce mode ({U} activation) would have been significantly more valuable. The opponent has creatures with multiple +1/+1 counters (Trusty Retriever 5/6, Tempered Veteran 3/6) that are growing each turn via Tempered Veteran's ability. Bouncing one of these would remove all counters and tempo the opponent significantly. A random draw is much less impactful than a targeted bounce in this board state.",
