      "description": "Used Tempered Veteran's expensive ability ({4}{W}{W}) when the cheap ability ({W}) would have worked identically, since both creatures on board already have +1/+1 counters. This wasted 5 mana, preventing casting Bulwark Giant (which would have gained 5 life and provided a 3/6 blocker) while at 11 life facing Scholar of the Lost Trove 5/5 and Markov Warlord 4/4.",
